<p>MON  Chemserve YR EPS   76.8	75-78.5	  67.3</p>
<p>MON  Chemserve YR DIV   24.3	23-26	    21.0</p>
<p>MON  Kersaf   H1 EPS   170.6     169.1-173.5    147.0</p>
<p>MON  Kersaf   H1 DIV   92.8	92.0-94.4	80.0</p>
<p>TUE  Trencor  H1 EPS   60.3	51.9-72	  51.9</p>
